{"sha": "6f03c4aa734ef870412737814064d365efef8a52f4ca5df869ed2b266f4d55c7", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g8:speed} 章 --- 正比例、速度与平均数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:1}", "$\\frac{150}{2} = 75$ km/h. \\quad", "$45$ 分钟 $= 0.75$ 小时：$\\frac{27}{0.75} = 36$ km/h。 \\quad", "$\\frac{100}{12.5} = 8$ m/s.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:2}", "$2 \\times 85 = 170$ km. \\quad", "$40$ 分钟 $= \\frac23$ 小时：$90 \\times \\frac23 = 60$ km。 \\quad", "$\\frac{315}{90} = 3.5$ 小时 $= 3$ 小时 $30$ 分钟。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:3}", "$72 \\div 3.6 = 20$ m/s. \\quad", "$5 \\times 3.6 = 18$ km/h. \\quad", "$108 \\div 3.6 = 30$ m/s.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:4}", "$600 \\div 15 = 40$ 分钟。 \\quad", "$2$ 小时 $30 = 150$ 分钟：$15 \\times 150 = 2250$ L。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:5}", "$\\frac{3.30}{1.2} = 2.75$ 欧元/千克，对比", "$\\frac{2.16}{0.8} = 2.70$ 欧元/千克：第二种报价", "略微更划算。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:6}", "\\[", "\\bar v = \\frac{25 \\times 12.4 + 35 \\times 10}{60}", "= \\frac{310 + 350}{60} = \\frac{660}{60} = 11 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:7}", "$d = 340 \\times 6 = 2040$ m $\\approx 2$ km.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:8}", "距离：$2 \\times 5 = 10$ km，再 $1.5 \\times 4 = 6$ km，总计", "$16$ km。所用时间：$2 + 0.5 + 1.5 = 4$ 小时。平均速度：", "$\\frac{16}{4} = 4$ km/h.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:9}", "加权平均数：", "$\\frac{3 \\times 15 + 2 \\times 9 + 1 \\times 12}{3 + 2 + 1}", "= \\frac{45 + 18 + 12}{6} = \\frac{75}{6} = 12.5$.", "不加权平均数：$\\frac{15 + 9 + 12}{3} = 12$。两者不同，是因为", "权数使分数 $15$ 的权重", "是分数 $12$ 的三倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:10}", "\\emph{1.} 时间：$\\frac{120}{80} = 1.5$ 小时和 $\\frac{120}{120} = 1$", "小时。平均速度：$\\frac{240}{2.5} = 96$ km/h。", "", "\\emph{2.} 汽车在 $80$ km/h 下花费 \\emph{更多时间}（$1.5$ 小时）", "比在 $120$ km/h 下（$1$ 小时）多：较慢的速度在", "按时间加权的平均数中权重更大，使其低于中点 $100$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:speed:11}", "两人之间的 $18$ km 间距以 $5 + 4 = 9$ km/h 的速度缩小：", "$\\frac{18}{9} = 2$ 小时后相遇，时间为 $12{:}00$。安娜此时已走过", "$2 \\times 5 = 10$ km：两人在距安娜的村庄 $10$ km 处相遇（", "且距鲍里斯的村庄 $8$ km --- 检验：$10 + 8 = 18$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g8:speed:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 由\\cref{def:g8:speed:def}可知，$t_1 = \\frac{d}{v_1}$ 与", "$t_2 = \\frac{d}{v_2}$；全程所用时间为", "$\\frac{d}{v_1} + \\frac{d}{v_2}$，路程为 $2d$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 从分母中提出 $d$，并将其", "约去：", "\\[", "\\bar v", "= \\frac{2d}{d\\left(\\frac{1}{v_1} + \\frac{1}{v_2}\\right)}", "= \\frac{2}{\\ \\frac{1}{v_1} + \\frac{1}{v_2}\\ } .", "\\]", "括号内通分：", "$\\frac{1}{v_1} + \\frac{1}{v_2} = \\frac{v_2 + v_1}{v_1 v_2}$，并", "除以一个数即乘以它的倒数", "（\\cref{thm:g8:fractions:div}）：", "\\[", "\\bar v = 2 \\times \\frac{v_1 v_2}{v_1 + v_2}", "= \\frac{2\\, v_1 v_2}{v_1 + v_2} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\dfrac{2 \\times 30 \\times 15}{30 + 15}", "= \\dfrac{900}{45} = 20$ km/h，与", "\\cref{ex:g8:speed:twolegs}中的结果一致；", "$\\dfrac{2 \\times 80 \\times 120}{80 + 120} = \\dfrac{19\\,200}{200}", "= 96$ km/h，与\\cref{exo:g8:speed:10}中求得的结果一致。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 平均速度只取决于两个速度，与", "$d$ 无关：$1$ km 的往返与 $100$ km 的往返，", "在相同的两种速度下，平均速度恰好相同。（这正是", "公式能够在不同长度的行程上检验的原因。）", "", "\\textbf{5.} 若在每种速度下行驶时间均为 $T$，则路程分别为 $v_1 T$", "和 $v_2 T$，于是", "\\[", "\\bar v = \\frac{v_1 T + v_2 T}{2T}", "= \\frac{(v_1 + v_2)\\,T}{2T}", "= \\frac{v_1 + v_2}{2} .", "\\]", "速度的平均数总是按 \\emph{时间} 加权", "（\\cref{def:g8:speed:average}）。时间相同时，两个速度", "权重相等：即普通的中点。路程相等时，", "较慢的速度占用 \\emph{更多} 时间，因而权重更大 ---", "平均数便向它偏移。", ""]}